                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C[(sat(\Sigma))^{-1}]
            can be constructed. An easy argument then establishes the following sharpened lemma:
          .un_lemma
            %h6#lemma_2 Lemma
            %p
              If
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
